# PE files in the app (release/PPSA99404) built from source by tools/build.sh; tools/build.sh
# audit copies this list into the app folder as .audit-allow while it audits, then removes it.
# Wine's Windows modules (host Wine and Wine's PS5 modules, wowprospero, wow64native):
win/wine/lib/wine/i386-windows/*
win/wine/lib/wine/x86_64-windows/*
# Mesa's WGL/Zink (opengl32.dll and its driver), built from PS5_Mesa:
win/mesa-zink/i386-windows/*
win/mesa-zink/x86_64-windows/*
# The bare prefix the bundle carries: Wine's builtin DLLs and programs as the prefix step's
# wineboot installs them, and our DXVK (d3d8/9/10core/11, dxgi), in system32 and syswow64.
assets/bundle/bare-prefix-sahin.zip!drive_c/windows/system32/*
assets/bundle/bare-prefix-sahin.zip!drive_c/windows/syswow64/*
